        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.107,
            0.689,
            0.224
          ],
          "content": "2. Find the values using suitable identities: (i) $1 7 \\times 2 1$ (ii) $1 0 4 \\times 9 6$ (iii) $2 4 \\times 1 6$ (iv) $1 4 7 ^ { 3 }$ (v) $1 9 9 ^ { 3 }$ (vi) $1 2 7 ^ { 3 }$ (vii) $( - 1 0 7 ) ^ { 3 }$ (viii) $(-299)^{3}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.228,
            0.753,
            0.602
          ],
          "content": "3. Factor the following algebraic expressions: (i) $4 y ^ { 2 } + 1 + \\frac { 1 } { 1 6 y ^ { 2 } }$ (ii) $9 m ^ { 2 }   -   \\frac { 1 } { 2 5 n ^ { 2 } }$ (iii) $2 7 b ^ { 3 } - \\frac { 1 } { 6 4 b ^ { ^ 3 } }$ (iv) $x ^ { 2 }   +   { \\frac { 5 x } { 6 } }   +   { \\frac { 1 } { 6 } }$ (v) $27u^{3}-\\frac{1}{125}-\\frac{27u^{2}}{5}+\\frac{9u}{25}$ (vi) $6 4 y ^ { 3 }   +   \\frac { 1 } { 1 2 5 } z ^ { 3 }$ (vii) $p^{3}+27q^{3}+r^{3}-9pqr$ $9m^{2}-12m+4$ (ix) $9x^{3}-\\frac{8}{3}y^{3}+\\frac{z^{3}}{3}+6xyz$ (x) $4x^{2}+9y^{2}+36z^{2}+12xz+36yz+24xy$ (xi) $27u^{3}-\\frac{1}{216}-\\frac{9u^{2}}{2}+\\frac{u}{4}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.608,
            0.875,
            0.686
          ],
          "content": "4. Simplify the following: (i) $\\frac{4x^{2} + 4x + 1}{4x^{2} - 1}$ (ii) $\\frac{9\\left(3a^{3}-24b^{3}\\right)}{9a^{2}-36b^{2}}$ (iii) $\\frac { s ^ { 3 }   +   1 2 5 t ^ { 3 } } { s ^ { 2 }   -   2 s t   -   3 5 t ^ { 2 } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.694,
            0.752,
            0.715
          ],
          "content": "**Note:** Assume that the denominators are not equal to 0."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.721,
            0.886,
            0.806
          ],
          "content": "5. Find possible expressions for the length and breadth of each of the following rectangles whose areas are given by the following expressions in square units. (i) $25a^{2}-30ab+9b^{2}$ (ii) $3 6 s ^ { 2 } - 4 9 t ^ { 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.812,
            0.886,
            0.872
          ],
          "content": "6. Find possible expressions for the length, breadth, and heights of each of the following cuboids whose volumes are given by the following expressions in cubic units."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.876,
